#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/visionportal_camera_controls/visionportal-camera-controls.rst:142
msgid "*Gain can be managed in coordination with exposure.*"
msgstr "*Gain can be managed in coordination with exposure.*"

#: ../../source/apriltag/vision_portal/visionportal_camera_controls/visionportal-camera-controls.rst:144
msgid "Actually, in the SDK, Gain **must** be managed with Exposure."
msgstr "実際、SDKでは、Gain **must** は露出と共に管理されます。"

